    {
        "content": "<p>There are two goals up to 10 case splits (<code>if f.b10</code>...), after that I get the max steps error.</p>",
        "id": 607681646,
        "sender_full_name": "Josh Cohen",
        "timestamp": 1782931484
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>looks like <code>split</code> calls <code>simp</code> to simplify away <code>match</code>es and <code>if</code>-<code>then</code>-<code>else</code> statements that have been split</p>",
        "id": 607682788,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1782931859
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>see <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Lean.Meta.simpIfLocalDecl#doc\">docs#Lean.Meta.simpIfLocalDecl</a></p>",
