        "timestamp": 1782931912
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think it would be reasonable to open an issue about this on the lean4 repo. This is a scaling issue in <code>split</code> we need to address. (Quoting Aaron's diagnosis in the issue would be helpful!)</p>",
